issue remains: this is a visualization layer, not a logging implementation. It assumes the centralized log store and structured event recording already exist. If they don't, this dashboard has nothing to show. And building it before the core logging infrastructure is solid means you'll be rebuilding it as the log schema evolves during prototyping.\n\nI'll go with reject, promise around 40-50. It's a reasonable idea but poorly scoped for the prototyping phase and doesn't address the foundational technical challenge (automatic event recording per Article 12(1)).\n",
