l-motivated verification activity that directly supports demonstrating Article 12 compliance. The promise score should be high but not absolute - it's a supporting activity, not the primary compliance mechanism itself, and its value depends on being properly scoped to the regulatory requirements. I'd say around 82-85.\n\nLet me settle: approve, promise 83.\n",
